$gameParty.size() gives you the number of people in the party. So assuming you want to run your code if there are at least two people in the party, you can use
Code:
if ($gameParty.size() >= 2) {
  // run your code here
}
You can find the list of script calls here:
https://forums.rpgmakerweb.com/index.php?threads/rpg-maker-mv-mz-script-call-list.46456/

